            <history xml:id="history_225N2017B">
               <p xml:id="idm111">According to Dan Fog, the first edition was published in 1857. This must be a mistake, as the autograph score was dated 9 Feb. 1881. According to Bent From: "Wilhelm Hansen Musik Forlag 1857-1997", the first work by Hartmann published by Wilhelm Hansen was "Suite for violin og Klaver", opus 66 (HartW 61) in 1867.</p>
